{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "6e8d22e7bff6bbf124c90dff4e2d3d76d7941619101e2a5436d72730b5c8b4b4", "ja": "警察犬の取材のお仕事", "zh": "采访警犬的工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6000_place", "source_sha256": "db8ed53ee9df7634448d8c03a4ff0db5cb49b58fef94543c234467ebd0ce37db", "ja": "運動公園", "zh": "运动公园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6001_p", "source_sha256": "e7b8973cb1ff8796889b2513100a44fb75e9dd989060b0006b2b78c7ab164b87", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の企画で、\n警察犬の取材にきている。美也は興味津々のようだ）", "zh": "（今天是来配合写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的企划，采访警犬。美也好像非常感兴趣。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6002_042miy", "source_sha256": "ba2c0309b33514106d4b45106a8f5983790fb01895be8c36d4d44b2813e2c19a", "ja": "わあ～！　{$P$}さん、\n見ましたか？　警察犬さんがジャンプしました～。", "zh": "哇～！　{$P$}先生，\n您看到了吗？警犬先生跳起来了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6003_042miy", "source_sha256": "b2590f759295afbd64cc181bbca36699591528becd2e31bf974be58c14fb126b", "ja": "トレーナーさんの言葉を聞いていて、賢いですね～。\nそれに凛々しさは、本物のおまわりさんみたいです♪", "zh": "听着训导员说话，它真聪明啊～  \n而且这威风凛凛的样子，简直就像真正的警察一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6004_p", "source_sha256": "fad8f3eb015bbb3b06667433dd1fe2db85ead118afb7ba11cc36289df8465b3d", "ja": "ああ。いつもと違う状況でも動じないし、さすがだ。\nこの感動を、うまく伝えられるといいな。", "zh": "啊啊。即使面对和平时不同的情况也毫不慌张，不愧是它。\n要是能把这份感动好好传达出去就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6005_042miy", "source_sha256": "d95d1317a3f877cde0f6dbf711b2ca54894917dc91c1d160988980c81b6c67ec", "ja": "はい～。警察犬さんのすごさが伝わるように、\n私も、精一杯頑張りますよ～。", "zh": "好的～为了让大家感受到警犬先生的厉害，我也会竭尽全力哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6006_042miy", "source_sha256": "a68c358cba25d764a286984cafb08ab4ac13387dac1d7ab0df35e1c02fddab90", "ja": "そこで、ひとつ相談が……。この後、警察犬さんと\nトレーニングしている姿を撮るんですよね？", "zh": "所以，有件事想跟您商量一下……接下来要拍我和警犬先生一起训练的样子，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6007_042miy", "source_sha256": "ed129cc4a761a08a41777bf32b524cfef9ee070d535972ad768b703d2aa0da72", "ja": "どういうことをしたら、\n警察犬さんが、一番かっこよく見えるでしょうか～？", "zh": "要做些什么，才能让警犬先生看起来最帅气呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6008_p", "source_sha256": "4d1c2ec3d38973340e9141dcc71b8760e59f03d434e0f75db0f80927da5cdaa8", "ja": "うーん、美也も警察犬も、\n素敵に見えるのがいいと思うけど、そうだな……。", "zh": "嗯——我觉得还是让美也和警犬都显得很帅气比较好，不过，这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6009", "source_sha256": "9771e4a639bb799703ce8e79e74d3ccf53dc4e4a882a29be84b0faf83b28f6d3", "ja": "障害物走", "zh": "障碍赛跑", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6010", "source_sha256": "64973dd0075a6428c3e28bf8243027969c9f966816f6058954519a394f2a6104", "ja": "フライングディスク", "zh": "飞盘", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6011", "source_sha256": "b4a24d249ec09eedd5fe58ca1e90e301cb61a0c690c111fee0a17d9525a542b1", "ja": "犯人探し", "zh": "寻找犯人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6100_p", "source_sha256": "39231a20a5e113888510934cd5a2f5b2bda57924040a8b606a4ab11a04883d41", "ja": "障害物走なんてどうかな？　警察犬の機敏さも出るし、\n美也と一緒なら楽しさも伝わると思う。", "zh": "障碍物赛跑怎么样？既能展现警犬的敏捷，和美也一起的话，我觉得也能让大家感受到乐趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6101_042miy", "source_sha256": "f6bbc3806680cfc7d56178db9256230423fbc30c86afe925cc4550cdd010e116", "ja": "いいですね～。警察犬さんの競争相手になるかは\nわかりませんが、私も頑張りますよ～。むふふ♪", "zh": "挺不错的呢～。虽然不知道能不能\n当警犬先生的竞争对手，但我也会加油的哦～。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6102_042miy", "source_sha256": "454c22d90f6b0b15e7c7e5eefa788c2146082fb07a73d91e1e5d0cb4fbdb2210", "ja": "まずは、しっかり準備運動をしておかないと～。\n{$P$}さん、手伝ってください♪", "zh": "首先，得好好做准备运动才行呢～。\n{$P$}先生，请来帮帮我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6200_p", "source_sha256": "40999e63c85e1ab6fea7613c391953f529d300d7b324d64e8c4b17f57cc4044e", "ja": "フライングディスクはどうだろう？\n警察犬の運動能力の高さを見せられるんじゃないか。", "zh": "飞盘怎么样？\n这样应该能展现警犬出色的运动能力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6201_042miy", "source_sha256": "943d355bb542592f9e985c9d88867fb8cc5013bab54b679996e7e31430a3c77c", "ja": "ふむふむ……。警察犬さんがたかーくジャンプして、\nキャッチする姿が浮かびますね～。", "zh": "嗯嗯……我仿佛看到了警犬高高跃起、接住飞盘的身影呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6202_042miy", "source_sha256": "888c36b1b1339f09acf0284ad96545e30b58beef0affcf2b63cf4b7170874eec", "ja": "あとは私が、上手に投げられるか……。\n責任重大ですな～。……私、練習してきます～！", "zh": "接下来就看我能不能好好扔出去了……责任重大呢～……我去练习一下～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6300_p", "source_sha256": "ef1c8f191ee21231740b47d7196bc6cac0bbe5c4fe52a54649c98d214009c673", "ja": "俺が犯人役になるから、匂いで探してもらうとか？\n犯人探しは、警察犬ならではの能力だと思うんだ。", "zh": "我来扮演犯人，让它根据气味来找我之类的？  \n寻找犯人可是警犬特有的本领啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6301_042miy", "source_sha256": "fc3e73cf3763048faf16e0b1619812f183b54f6cf116824f357f3a47412cc164", "ja": "なるほど～。ワンちゃんは鼻が利きますからね～。\n犯人に立ち向かう姿はかっこよさそうです～。", "zh": "原来如此～狗狗的鼻子很灵嘛～。面对犯人的样子，感觉会很帅气呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_042miy_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_042miy_6302_042miy", "source_sha256": "a688590646bcffde853081f4e6ac99a19b9474dadc56821c0655aa91145c02fc", "ja": "でもそれだと、{$P$}さんが、\n一番目立ってしまうような……いいんでしょうか～？", "zh": "不过那样的话，{$P$}先生好像会变得最显眼……这样真的好吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
